# TILTSHOT: a slam onto a slope that falls away sends the ball racing down
# it, on fire, much faster than it came; a slam onto flat ground only makes
# it bounce, and a ball that just drops onto the slope is no faster.
seed 4
game tiltshot
wait 5
cheat hole 1
wait 2
# over the long slope down from the rise (x 304 to 368)
cheat ball 322 40 1.2 0
wait 1
press A
waituntil fire > 0 60
expect speed100 > 600
expect ball_vx100 > 400
waituntil phase == 0 3000
expect ball_x > 600
# the same drop without the slam: no fire, a slower roll
cheat ball 322 40 1.2 0
waituntil ball_y > 90 60
wait 6
expect fire == 0
expect speed100 < 450
waituntil phase == 0 3000
# a slam onto the flat: a bounce, no fire
cheat ball 560 40 1.2 0
wait 1
press A
waituntil ball_vy100 < 0 60
expect fire == 0
